@startuml
!theme plain
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title repo-current-state — Verified Recovery Snapshot

actor "Maintainer / Agent" as maintainer
rectangle "Merged Plan PR\nSource branch deleted\nDefault branch synchronized" as delivery
rectangle "Repository evidence\nGit state / files / config / issue status" as evidence
rectangle "repo-current-state\nVerification rules" as skill
rectangle "docs/Repo_Current_State.md\nCompact verified recovery point" as snapshot
rectangle "Canonical documentation\nREADME + docs/" as docs
database "GitHub Issues\nPlan / Ticket status" as issues

maintainer --> skill : invoke after verified state change
delivery --> evidence : post-merge truth
issues --> evidence : durable work status
skill --> evidence : verify only relevant facts
evidence --> snapshot : replace stale facts with current facts
snapshot --> docs : point to detailed owners
maintainer --> snapshot : resume from exact current state

note right of snapshot
Not a backlog.
Not a session transcript.
Not a duplicate of GitHub Issues.
end note
@enduml
